  "details": "I've been working on a new avatar and I have an issue with dynamic bones\n\nI don't really have any idea why and what caused this but my dynamic bones seemed to start freaking out in game\n\nI'm not really good at blender and unity so I can't figure out how did this happen, I never had a problem similar to this before.\nThis is how it looks ingame\nhttps://imgur.com/gallery/MwD3udD\nHere's some image of how I set my values for the bones https://imgur.com/gallery/sF7nw0Q\n\nBut I dont think it has anything to do with that, I think I just messed up my model somehow\n\nBecause I've tried alot of different values, it still give me the shaking dynamic bones\n\nAlso even when I try to remove dynamic bones collider it didnt help too.\n\nI really want to get this model fixed. x(\n\nAdd me on discord: miuthepotato#9239\n\nSo it would be easier to talk about this problem\n\nThanks! <3",
